# Netlify redirect map — Prime Wires
#
# products.html carried the whole range as anchored sections. It is retired.
# Six of its seven anchors were stitching grades, so it 301s to the stitching
# wires category. A 301 whose Location carries no fragment of its own preserves
# the incoming fragment, and every old id is reproduced on the new page:
#
#   #gi #rp #pw #copper-coated #brass #copper  -> the seven grade blocks
#   #book                                      -> the book & narrow flat section
#   #steel                                     -> the Steel Wires cross-link block
#
# Fragments are never sent to the server, so they cannot be redirected
# individually; reproducing the ids is what keeps every old inbound link live.

/products.html    /stitching-wires.html    301
/products         /stitching-wires.html    301
